#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:3
#: c2882b66fc1f4f5b9f56bdb73d9cdc0c
#
msgid "剪切角应变（Shear Angle Strain）"
msgstr "Shear Angle Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:5
#: 6d6c37b58f354344bb4a0fd50fed6980
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:7
#: 120bd2337f71462c9f2c2a2727cee3a5
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:9
#: 7a269dbe577e44128c98bcdc3d1389ac
msgid "保持三条晶格矢量的长度不变，扫描晶格角的增量。适合单独补充角度形变数据，或检查模型对低对称晶胞的外推误差。"
msgstr ""
"Scan increments of the lattice angles while keeping all three lattice-"
"vector lengths fixed. Use this card to add angle-deformation data "
"independently or to examine model extrapolation for low-symmetry cells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:11
#: 514afb551b0e40248b8ef2f6d0f3e7b0
msgid "三个角的定义是："
msgstr "The three angles are defined as:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:13
#: e5714cc2afa245de84cc433c416dcb06
msgid "$\\alpha=\\angle(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:14
#: 396b16eb622a4e60a868c2b86daf6f72
msgid "$\\beta=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf c)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:15
#: 9a5c00b505624131ac5b516ac24ccb4a
msgid "$\\gamma=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:17
#: 76527f91937d4d21836eb77e3d83505e
msgid "输入框填写的是相对原始角度的**增量**，不是最终角度，单位均为度。"
msgstr ""
"The fields specify **increments** relative to the original angles, not "
"final angles. All values are in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:19
#: e6fe95ce40ae45f4baa571c6af207891
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:21
#: b21f6af501f9486e9b2944167e4ea900
msgid "对每组增量 $(\\Delta\\alpha,\\Delta\\beta,\\Delta\\gamma)$："
msgstr "For each increment tuple $(\\Delta\\alpha,\\Delta\\beta,\\Delta\\gamma)$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:23
#: 8f5ae0e34aad4289b9bee4e50a50627d
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\alpha'=\\alpha+\\Delta\\alpha,\\qquad\n"
"\\beta'=\\beta+\\Delta\\beta,\\qquad\n"
"\\gamma'=\\gamma+\\Delta\\gamma.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:29
#: 3b89fb7a8c1c4079a9ee4c5362d43e5e
msgid ""
"程序用 $(a,b,c,\\alpha',\\beta',\\gamma')$ 重建晶胞，其中 $a,b,c$ "
"保持原值。原子分数坐标随晶胞保持不变，因此笛卡尔位置会随形变移动。"
msgstr ""
"The program reconstructs the cell from "
"$(a,b,c,\\alpha',\\beta',\\gamma')$, keeping $a,b,c$ at their original "
"values. Atomic fractional coordinates remain fixed relative to the cell, "
"so Cartesian positions move with the deformation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:31
#: f8bdd3cdb9a2497cbcb59167bf4af74f
msgid ""
"重建过程保留输入晶胞的全局取向，不额外施加刚体旋转。因此项目使用的 `spin:R:3` 和 ASE 的 `initial_magmoms` "
"均保留原笛卡尔分量。若输入同时含有这两类磁矩数据，两者都不会被角度应变改写。"
msgstr ""
"Reconstruction preserves the global orientation of the input cell and "
"adds no rigid rotation. Therefore, both the project's `spin:R:3` data and"
" ASE `initial_magmoms` retain their original Cartesian components. If the"
" input contains both forms, neither is modified by the angle strain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:33
#: 7ff6fec2b0e64c658fe64aecbd1e4bbf
msgid ""
"每个角范围按 `[min, max, step]` 取点。若三条范围分别产生 $N_\\alpha$、$N_\\beta$、$N_\\gamma$"
" 个值，则："
msgstr ""
"Each angle range is sampled as `[min, max, step]`. If the three ranges "
"produce $N_\\alpha$, $N_\\beta$, and $N_\\gamma$ values, respectively:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:35
#: 184c935d87e444448076706a73cf9caa
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}N_\\alpha N_\\beta N_\\gamma.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:39
#: 9fad809e72e44701b61679a90bb80665
msgid ""
"默认每条范围为 `[-2, 2, 2]`，对应小角度弹性响应中的负向、参考和正向三点， 即每个输入生成 $3^3=27$ "
"个结构。界面会直接显示每个输入和全部输入的预计输出数。"
msgstr ""
"Each range defaults to `[-2, 2, 2]`, representing negative, reference, "
"and positive points for a small-angle elastic response. Each input "
"therefore produces $3^3=27$ structures. The interface shows estimated "
"counts per input and across all inputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:42
#: 9bc79ac2afce4dee8ea5c4d89a6d4754
msgid "最终三个角必须都位于 $(0^\\circ,180^\\circ)$，并能组成非奇异、右手晶胞；不满足时会提示减小角度增量。"
msgstr ""
"All three final angles must lie within $(0^\\circ,180^\\circ)$ and form a"
" nonsingular, right-handed cell. Otherwise, the program asks you to "
"reduce the angle increments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:44
#: 5da95ea8ab3b48b1a7d5f3ed867de50f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:46
#: 9e09f565c057463cb5673442f8dffd9f
msgid "只扫描 $\\beta$ 角的 $-4^\\circ$ 到 $4^\\circ$，步长 $2^\\circ$："
msgstr ""
"To scan only $\\beta$ from $-4^\\circ$ to $4^\\circ$ in steps of "
"$2^\\circ$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:48
#: 4291990142ec46a9b8778346e69b852c
msgid ""
"Alpha increment: 0, 0, 1\n"
"Beta increment: -4, 4, 2\n"
"Gamma increment: 0, 0, 1\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:54
#: 4a7b538005aa4e80bd95961c5f58bdb6
msgid ""
"每个输入得到 5 个结构，对应 $\\Delta\\beta=-4,-2,0,2,4^\\circ$。三条晶格矢量长度不变；$\\alpha$ 和"
" $\\gamma$ 不变。"
msgstr ""
"Each input produces five structures corresponding to "
"$\\Delta\\beta=-4,-2,0,2,4^\\circ$. All lattice-vector lengths remain "
"fixed, as do $\\alpha$ and $\\gamma$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:56
#: 66b8a5f62705403c9009eed4112ecb36
msgid "不扫描某一通道时应填写 `[0, 0, 1]`。步长仍需为正数。"
msgstr ""
"Enter `[0, 0, 1]` for an angle that is not scanned. Its step must still "
"be positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:58
#: d0a6b7102fe9437db3aafea4c7f36954
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:60
#: 75ebc8ab5f8649bb9ed02d81eca14192
msgid "α 增量（alpha_range）"
msgstr "α Increment (alpha_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:62
#: 5056cc3ed1ea489a82993b592f7a9197
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。$\\alpha=\\angle(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c)$ 的增量范围，单位为度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Increment range for $\\alpha=\\angle(\\mathbf "
"b,\\mathbf c)$, in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:64
#: a910255282604e149f9dd144a5766d02
msgid "β 增量（beta_range）"
msgstr "β Increment (beta_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:66
#: 15af312232f24760b19303987dcab361
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。$\\beta=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf c)$ 的增量范围，单位为度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Increment range for $\\beta=\\angle(\\mathbf "
"a,\\mathbf c)$, in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:68
#: 130037fd15a9424da12a073f5688ee28
msgid "γ 增量（gamma_range）"
msgstr "γ Increment (gamma_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:70
#: aee5a50751e04f62831f8c5ea7cac6d6
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。$\\gamma=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)$ 的增量范围，单位为度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Increment range for $\\gamma=\\angle(\\mathbf "
"a,\\mathbf b)$, in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:72
#: 9b22e7f46f844ea0ab5a738d715a7e06
msgid "保持识别出的分子刚性（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Preserve Detected Molecular Rigidity (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:74
#: 7e59328acf784b588be75e673ebad7c3
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，程序在晶胞仿射形变后恢复检测到的分子团内部几何，避免分子内键随晶胞一起拉伸。纯无机体系通常无需开启。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, the program restores the internal "
"geometry of detected molecular groups after the affine cell deformation, "
"preventing intramolecular bonds from stretching with the cell. It is "
"normally unnecessary for purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:76
#: 1ee543884eb743fdb41a6cc12ff50f1f
msgid "配置示例"
msgstr "Configuration Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:78
#: e8c74ac1f6074a3b812cc6368b30d96a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ShearAngleCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"alpha_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"beta_range\": [-4, 4, 2],\n"
"    \"gamma_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:91
#: ecaf8770c8214d1ba97ca070448c8050
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:93
#: 14411513e223494bba2e81880dae1620
msgid "**为什么角度改变后体积也变了？** 体积同时取决于晶格长度和夹角。长度固定不代表体积固定，这是正常的几何结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the volume change when only angles are changed?** Volume "
"depends on both lattice-vector lengths and their angles. Fixed lengths do"
" not imply fixed volume; this is the expected geometry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:95
#: 31a1ac085999465b83948f94db600c2b
msgid ""
"**为什么输出数很快变大？** 三个角采用笛卡尔积组合。默认是 $3\\times3\\times3=27$ "
"个结构/输入；增加点数前应先确认确实需要联合扫描，而不是单角有限差分。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the output count grow so quickly?** The three angle ranges "
"form a Cartesian product, giving $3\\times3\\times3=27$ structures per "
"input by default. Before adding points, confirm that a joint scan is "
"needed rather than a one-angle finite difference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:97
#: 60c11f90ccef4ccb9f37b4e2956848b4
msgid ""
"**为什么提示晶胞无效？** 某组最终角度无法组成非奇异右手晶胞。缩小增量范围，尤其要检查原始角度已经接近 $0^\\circ$ 或 "
"$180^\\circ$ 的情况。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the cell reported as invalid?** A set of final angles cannot "
"form a nonsingular, right-handed cell. Reduce the increment range, "
"especially when an original angle is already close to $0^\\circ$ or "
"$180^\\circ$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:99
#: 3dc79ab35a684ac2a041b5bc3e2f4f9b
msgid ""
"**磁矩会跟着晶胞转动吗？** 不会。这张卡只做角度应变并保留输入全局坐标系；`spin:R:3` 与 ASE `initial_magmoms`"
" 的笛卡尔分量均保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Do magnetic moments rotate with the cell?** No. This card applies angle"
" strain while preserving the input global coordinate system. Cartesian "
"components of both `spin:R:3` and ASE `initial_magmoms` remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:101
#: 3452f15c5bdf4957be2e98c86274258d
